{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"molarity-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"molarity-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["molarity-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Molarity ni kiasi cha solute katika moles kugawanywa na jumla ya kiasi ufumbuzi katika lita. Kwa mfano, ZXQPH0000QXZ mol katika ZXQPH0001QXZ L ya ufumbuzi ni ZXQPH0002QXZ mol / L (ZXQPH0003QXZ M). Matumizi ya mwisho ufumbuzi kiasi, si kiasi cha kiowevu kabla ya kuongeza solute.","record_id":"ce9e81bd23471cb896098debe28e380080f505e1ef6fea521cc912170423fff3","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.392444069874955,"source":"Molarity is the amount of solute in moles divided by the total solution volume in liters. For example, 1 mol in 2 L of solution is 0.5 mol/L (0.5 M). Use the final solution volume, not the volume of solvent before adding solute.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"7cb141aae44ff8a92ab6d76162ce5a2b4c9d18e59d5d12c5186327e785046520","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Molarity ni kiasi cha solute katika moles kugawanywa na jumla ya kiasi ufumbuzi katika lita. Kwa mfano, 1 mol katika 2 L ya ufumbuzi ni 0.5 mol / L (0.5 M). Matumizi ya mwisho ufumbuzi kiasi, si kiasi cha kiowevu kabla ya kuongeza solute.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
